Total valid assignments: 1
```

The program enumerates all 6 permutations of the three roles, evaluates each statement's truth value under that assignment, and checks it against each person's role-specific truth-telling rules. Exactly one assignment survives — confirming Alice is the knight, Bob is the spy, and Charlie is the knave.
